// APIKey lets a member call the API. It acts as that member, with the member's current role.
//
// The store keeps only the SHA-256 hash of the token (hex) and its last four characters. Token is set only on the value
// that creates the key, so the caller can show it once; it is empty everywhere else. Snapshots from before tokens were
// hashed carry the plain token in "token", which FromState hashes.
